Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `guard.map` needs a field projection
  --> tests/ui/ownership/local_cell_guard_map_rejects_detached_values.jet:4:30
    |
  4 |     _: cell.guard_read().map(fn(pair) { pair.left + pair.right })
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A mapped guard must point into the value covered by its original dynamic loan
 Fix: Write `.map(fn(value) { value.field })`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
